{"2093800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "METAL SUITS: Counter-attack", "steam_appid": 2093800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Don't tick him off!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Exploding Vengeance]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.poster.avif?t=1787048281\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.webm?t=1787048281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/7d2bbcefac13cd379c1c08638c718626.mp4?t=1787048281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kevin, the retired war hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having lost everything to the alien invaders,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he was reborn from the brink of death as a cyborg of fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, his explosive revenge drama begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Ultra-Fast Run &amp; Gun Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.poster.avif?t=1787048281\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.webm?t=1787048281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/e058824ff1722172b47a67cbdac24ee6.mp4?t=1787048281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dazzling effects covering the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful impact and thrilling feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience ultra-fast combat that awakens all your senses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Complete Your Style with Combat Suits]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.poster.avif?t=1787048281\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.webm?t=1787048281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/ad693574dbee6ee8df87f4da50358a26.mp4?t=1787048281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various suits during combat and use them strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suit awaits with unique looks and destructive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your own combat style and seize victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Perfect Harmony of Precision Controls, Puzzles &amp; Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.poster.avif?t=1787048281\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/f020276cbf9dffd4da682745b168a680.webm?t=1787048281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht